Package: stoneforge
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: MotusLabs <motuslabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), git
Homepage: https://github.com/MotusLabs/stoneforge
Description: Stoneforge agent orchestration platform (MotusLab build)
 Self-contained Stoneforge CLI and orchestrator runtime.
 Bundles a Node.js runtime, production dependencies including
 native modules (better-sqlite3, node-pty), and the smithy web UI
 under /opt/stoneforge. Provides the sf and stoneforge commands.
 .
 Part of the MotusLab Ubuntu release. User workspaces (.stoneforge/)
 are never modified by install, upgrade or removal.
